{#
    The branded frame every email shares: logo header, red rule, white card,
    navy footer. Sylius's emails reach it through
    bundles/SyliusCoreBundle/Email/layout.html.twig; ours extend it directly.

    Mail apps ignore stylesheets, so every style is inline, and the layout
    is tables because Outlook ignores most of CSS layout. Colours are the
    shop's: navy #1B2A5E (logo), CTA red #8B1A1A, sharp corners.

    Links are built with url()/absolute_url(): the request's host on the
    site, DEFAULT_URI in crons and the worker. (Sylius's sylius_channel_url()
    gives a bare path while the channel has no hostname, which in an email
    is a dead link.)

    Blocks: subject (Sylius emails), preheader (the inbox preview line),
    content.
#}
{% block body %}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
    <title>US Industrial Supply</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f2f3f5;">
    <div style="display: none; max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; mso-hide: all;">{% block preheader %}{% endblock %}</div>
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="background: #f2f3f5;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding: 24px 12px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="600" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px; background: #ffffff; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2933;">
                    <tr>
                        <td align="center" style="padding: 24px 32px 20px;">
                            <a href="{{ url('sylius_shop_homepage') }}" style="text-decoration: none;">
                                <img src="{{ absolute_url(asset('email/logo.png')) }}" width="220" alt="US Industrial Supply" style="display: block; width: 220px; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border: 0;">
                            </a>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="height: 4px; line-height: 4px; font-size: 0; background: #8B1A1A;">&nbsp;</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 32px;">
                            {% block content %}{% endblock %}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="background: #1B2A5E; color: #c9d2e3; padding: 20px 32px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; text-align: center;">
                            <strong style="color: #ffffff;">US Industrial Supply Chain Solutions</strong><br>
                            The products you count on. Delivered.<br>
                            <a href="{{ url('sylius_shop_homepage') }}" style="color: #ffffff;">usiscs.com</a>
                            &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;
                            <a href="{{ url('app_shop_contact') }}" style="color: #ffffff;">Contact us</a>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
{% endblock %}
